The club charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter[[cite:obs-ab7d204d726f2d42454aa043c6c9122ebb4b6960 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]. According to the annex, the ordinary contributions amount to one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January[[cite:obs-4c5424820ff823e72ed9a5715f7a3a48c7080a1b "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].